{"id":"2092086634422681864","platform":"x","account":{"username":"Wise1Philosophy"},"published_at":"2026-08-25T03:08:17Z","content":"you can now give an AI a real task and watch it actually execute the work Apodex 1.1 can work with raw files, data, code, and multiple agents, adapt when requirements change, recover from failures, and review important conclusions before delivery try it with your own files: http://apodex.ai star FrontierAgent: http://github.com/ApodexAI/FrontierAgent run Apodex 1.1 mini locally: http://huggingface.co/collections/apodex/apodex-11 Meet Apodex 1.1: Scaling Agentic Intelligence for Complex Work Open Source Harness: https://github.com/ApodexAI/FrontierAgent Open Weights: https://huggingface.co/collections/apodex/apodex-11 We’re excited to introduce Apodex 1.1, our new model family built to scale agentic intel…","url":"https://x.com/nrqa__/status/2092086634422681864","media":[{"type":"image","source_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2089607409731821568/PxnIGKDn?format=png&name=800x419","local_path":"assets/images/2026/08/25/2092086634422681864-1.png","sha256":"73bca47313635dec32a662ab8eb05171134991dd346b5fc78bd261523fa677e6"}],"metadata":{"collected_at":"2026-08-25T06:54:40Z","collector":"hermes"}}
{"id":"2092117375261053127","platform":"x","account":{"username":"Wise1Philosophy"},"published_at":"2026-08-25T05:10:26Z","content":"Apodex 1.1 landed yesterday and the chart is the interesting part. Claude Opus 5 is above them on four of the six benchmarks they published. GDPVal 89.4 to 78.8. HLE 64.7 to 56.1. They left every bar in. Their argument is that the benchmark is not the unit of work. Finishing a real task is. So the whole chain runs: → raw file in, schema and missing values checked, statistical method picked, code run, conclusion out with the evidence attached → subagents working in parallel, results merging into shared state as they land → you interrupting mid-task, it replanning only the broken part → a separate review pass that flags a bad citation before delivery Now the honest bit. A chart that puts you second on four of six is also a very good way to get people arguing about the two you won (FrontierFinance 54.3, FrontierScience-Research 63.3). I do not think that is an accident. Still a more useful claim than most launch posts make. @Apodex_AI Meet Apodex 1.1: Scaling Agentic Intelligence for Complex Work Open Source Harness: https://github.com/ApodexAI/FrontierAgent Open Weights: https://huggingface.co/collections/apodex/apodex-11 We’re excited to introduce Apodex 1.1, our new model family built to scale agentic intel…","url":"https://x.com/socialwithaayan/status/2092117375261053127","media":[{"type":"image","source_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQixqnHa4AAyFS8.jpg?name=orig","local_path":"assets/images/2026/08/25/2092117375261053127-1.jpg","sha256":"832e2adf15fde3280c846bc1acf4c2e9fb4046a15e72464d904ce2a2f3afe855"}],"metadata":{"collected_at":"2026-08-25T06:54:40Z","collector":"hermes"}}
{"id":"2092128873920254178","platform":"x","account":{"username":"Wise1Philosophy"},"published_at":"2026-08-25T05:56:08Z","content":"Le di a una IA 4 fotos de la misma persona y una idea imposible: convertir un ascensor en 4 universos sincronizados con la música. No grabé ni un solo plano. El vídeo con IA va más allá de los Prompts: Flova ofrece una solución «todo en uno» para la creación de vídeos con agentes nativos Y aproveché para comparar cómo resuelven la misma escena Seedance 2.0 y 2.5. Media","url":"https://x.com/SofiaSici/status/2092128873920254178","media":[{"type":"video","source_url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2092128843297648640/vid/avc1/720x720/T4vy3Gu8_VlpxOzV.mp4?tag=14"}],"metadata":{"collected_at":"2026-08-25T06:54:40Z","collector":"hermes"}}
